      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand your concerns, and I assure you that the Operational Transition Plan was meticulously crafted to minimize any negative impact on our high-frequency trading capabilities. The human-oversight component is designed to function as an additional layer of scrutiny, not as a bottleneck. High-frequency trades will still be executed at lightning speed, with the human oversight acting as a fail-safe mechanism for critical decision points, rather than a constant review process. The oversight will be automated to the extent possible, with humans stepping in only when the system flags an anomaly or when a significant trade decision is required. This ensures that our alpha generation remains robust while adhering to the new protocols. I will revise the summary to reflect these details and provide a more accurate representation of our strategy moving forward.",
